stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> submitted: Contractor submits RA Bill\n(linked to MB measurements + BOQ items)

    submitted --> approved: PM / project_admin approves\n(amount, retention checked,\nsignature captured)
    submitted --> rejected: PM rejects with reason\n(measurement mismatch / over-budget)

    rejected --> submitted: Contractor revises\n(updates MB rows, resubmits)
    rejected --> [*]: abandoned

    approved --> paid: Finance issues payment\n(via Cashfree / NEFT)\nbilling_history row written
    approved --> disputed: Client disputes claimed quantity\n(opens RFI / Change Order)

    disputed --> approved: Resolved in contractor's favour
    disputed --> rejected: Resolved against contractor\n(amount adjusted)

    paid --> [*]: cumulative + paid_amount stored\nretention released on project closeout

    note right of approved
        Audit log entry on every transition:
        APPROVE / REJECT / PAYMENT
    end note
